---
layout: layouts/base.njk
contentKey: audio-speed-pitch
ldType: tool
contentType: tool
permalink: /audio-speed-pitch/
sitemap: true
mainClass: wrap
pageScript: tools/audiotune.js
---
{% set c = toolpages[contentKey] %}
{% set t = toolList | toolBySlug(contentKey) %}
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
<div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Toolkit</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>{{ c.breadcrumb }}</span></div>

<section class="tool-hero">
  <div class="hero-row">
    <span class="icon-tile icon-hero {{ t.tone }}" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon(t.icon) }}</span>
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="kicker">{{ c.kicker }}</span>
      <h1>{{ c.h1 }}</h1>
      <p>{{ c.lede }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="workspace">
  <div class="pane">
    <div class="pane-head"><h2>Input</h2><span class="hint">video or audio</span></div>

    <div class="dropzone" id="atDropzone" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Choose a video or audio file">
      <div class="dz-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12h2l2-6 3 14 3-11 2 5h6"/></svg>
      </div>
      <b>Drop a video or audio file here, or click to choose</b>
      <span class="mini">MP4, MOV, WebM, MP3, WAV, M4A, OGG · nothing is uploaded</span>
    </div>
    <input class="visually-hidden" id="atFile" type="file" accept="video/*,audio/*">

    <p class="field-hint err" id="atError" role="alert" hidden></p>

    <div class="file-info" id="atInfo" hidden>
      <div class="meta-row"><span>File</span><b id="atName">—</b></div>
      <div class="meta-row"><span>Duration</span><b id="atDuration">—</b></div>
      <div class="meta-row"><span>Channels</span><b id="atChannels">—</b></div>
      <div class="meta-row"><span>Sample rate</span><b id="atRate">—</b></div>
    </div>

    <div class="field" style="margin-top:14px" id="atSpeedField">
      <span class="field-label">Speed</span>
      <div class="seg" id="atSpeedSeg" style="display:flex;width:100%">
        <button type="button" data-speed="0.5" aria-pressed="false">0.5x</button>
        <button type="button" data-speed="0.75" aria-pressed="false">0.75x</button>
        <button type="button" data-speed="1" class="on" aria-pressed="true">1x</button>
        <button type="button" data-speed="1.25" aria-pressed="false">1.25x</button>
        <button type="button" data-speed="1.5" aria-pressed="false">1.5x</button>
        <button type="button" data-speed="2" aria-pressed="false">2x</button>
      </div>
      <input type="hidden" id="atSpeed" value="1">
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="atPitch">Pitch (semitones)</label>
      <div class="range-row">
        <input type="range" id="atPitch" min="-6" max="6" step="0.5" value="0">
        <output id="atPitchValue">0 st</output>
      </div>
      <p class="field-hint">0 keeps the original pitch. A positive value raises it, a negative value lowers it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="meta-stack" id="atResult" style="grid-template-columns:auto auto;justify-content:start;gap:6px 20px" hidden>
      <div class="meta-row"><span>Playback factor</span><b id="atFactor">1.00x</b></div>
      <div class="meta-row"><span>Output length</span><b id="atOutLength">—</b></div>
      <div class="meta-row"><span>Pitch shift</span><b id="atOutPitch">0 st</b></div>
    </div>

    <div class="note"><span class="pin">i</span><span>This is a tape-style change: speed and pitch move together. Double speed makes the file half as long and an octave higher; slowing down stretches it and lowers the pitch. No time-stretching is applied.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="pane">
    <div class="pane-head"><h2>Waveform</h2><span class="hint" id="atHint">No file yet</span></div>

    <div class="canvas-box" style="min-height:180px;display:block">
      <canvas id="atWave" width="600" height="160" style="display:block;width:100%;height:160px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff" aria-label="Waveform of the loaded audio"></canvas>
      <span class="canvas-empty" id="atEmpty">Choose a file to draw its waveform.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="split-actions" style="margin-top:14px">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="atWavBtn" type="button" disabled>Download WAV</button>
      <button class="btn" id="atPngBtn" type="button" disabled>Download waveform PNG</button>
    </div>

    <div id="atProgressWrap" hidden style="margin-top:14px">
      <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="atProgress"></div></div>
      <div class="progress-label" id="atProgressLabel">0%</div>
    </div>

    <div class="empty-muted" id="atOutEmpty" style="margin-top:14px">Load a file to unlock the WAV and waveform PNG downloads.</div>

    <div class="note"><span class="pin">i</span><span>The WAV is re-rendered at the source sample rate and always keeps up to two channels. A longer file takes a moment to render.</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="below">
  <aside class="aside">
    <h2>Next tools</h2>
    <div class="related">
      {% for r in c.related %}{% set rt = toolList | toolBySlug(r.slug) %}
      <a href="{{ rt.url }}"><span class="icon-tile {{ r.tone }}" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon(rt.icon) }}</span><span><b>{{ rt.relatedName or rt.footerName or rt.name }}</b><small>{{ r.note }}</small></span></a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>
